# Pairs with UnreadableNeverRetired. The decision treats an unreadable leaf read
# as evidence the leaf is gone, so a storage fault retires a pin.
MODULE: UnreadableNeverRetiredFaultReadsAsHusk
TARGET: UnreadableNeverRetired
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an unreadable leaf read is decided as a husk
PERTURBS: Decide
BOUNDS: MaxFaults = 1

--- FIND
    /\ pinOff' = IF /\ verdict[p] = "husk"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: fail-open on an unreadable read.
    /\ pinOff' = IF /\ verdict[p] \in {"husk", "unreadable"}
--- END
